	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d12_visitor04_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しょうりポケモン
ビクティニ　か……▼
いまごろは　だれの　ために
その　ちからを　はっき　してるのかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T05:39:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>しょうりポケモン
ビクティニ　か……▼
いまごろは　だれの　ために
その能力を　発揮してるのかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T05:40:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX=299、GRIDZ=749、下向き
・手持ちにビクティニがいない
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-23T10:47:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SUNGLASSES</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T05:17:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
